WEBVTT

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:02.384
What if every town, every issue,

00:12:02.426 --> 00:12:04.511
every community

00:12:04.553 --> 00:12:08.390
had a giving circle with passionate
philanthropists like you?

00:12:10.851 --> 00:12:15.898
So if you're looking
for impact and connection

00:12:15.898 --> 00:12:17.941
and purpose

00:12:17.983 --> 00:12:20.027
and joy,

00:12:20.027 --> 00:12:22.738
join or start a giving circle,

00:12:22.738 --> 00:12:26.575
no matter if you have
five dollars to give or 50 million.

00:12:27.159 --> 00:12:29.787
No matter if you are a teacher

00:12:29.787 --> 00:12:32.915
or a tech leader or a lawyer or a mom.